@section('title')
  @@dd
@endsection

@section('content')
  <h1>@@dd</h1>
  <p><code>@@dd</code> prints a value and stops the page. Nothing after it is rendered, so it is useful to check the value at one exact point.</p>
<pre><code class="language-blade">@@dd($post)
&lt;p&gt;This line is not rendered.&lt;/p&gt;</code></pre>
  <h3>Live example</h3>
  <p>The dump below stops the page. Nothing after it should appear.</p>
  @dd($post)
  <p>If you can read this, @@dd did not stop rendering.</p>
@endsection
